## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **SH16 "stuck" root cause** — confirmed by reading `lib/agents/next-events.ts:569-643`:
  the `REV-shot_plan PASS → APPROVED → fire VGEN` auto-promotion is gated to
  `directorUserId === 'AUTOTEST'` (Mode 4 ONLY). Modes 1/2/3 ALL require an explicit
  plan approve before paid render (hard limit, CLAUDE.md §6). SH16 sat 07:11→07:18
  (DB timestamps) at the approval gate — not a bug; the lag was Polina's pickup, not code.
- **Mode discrepancy root cause** — confirmed via DB + code: topbar badge reads ONLY
  the global `app_config.governance_mode_default` (=3) at `app/(studio)/layout.tsx:16-32`,
  episode-agnostic; gate (`lib/agents/gate.ts:549-561`) + Polina (q13 `resolve-mode.ts`)
  read per-episode `episodes.governance_mode` (E10 = 2). Prior fix `3fd92fd` (q13)
  unified concierge+gate but NOT the topbar → badge is the lone outlier. Display bug.
- **Sticky pipeline + collapsible settings (Part 1)** — confirmed live (preview DOM):
  `position:sticky` + `self-start`, card top 1491→56 on scroll; settings collapsed by
  default (checkbox hidden), header click toggles `aria-expanded` false↔true. tsc 0.
- **Left rail + resizable divider (Part 2)** — confirmed live (preview DOM, 1440):
  rail left=264 top=198 (full-height from top, under header); divider drag rail 360→540,
  right col 752→572 (−180, redistributes); width persisted localStorage=540 survived
  reload; stage click → "WORKSTATION · Writer · SCRIPT CRITIC VERDICT PASS"; mobile (<lg)
  `flex-direction:column` stacks + divider `display:none`. tsc 0 · 892/892 tests.
- **Both UI commits pushed** — `git push` returned `4493648..4bc8f12` then `4bc8f12..5276350`.
  Master in sync with origin.

