## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **First EpisodeSettingsCard edit looked broken in preview** — turbopack served a
  STALE compile ("Unterminated regexp literal at `</Card>`") from the transient moment
  the `{!collapsed && (` wrapper was added before its closing `)}`. tsc passed (cached
  tsbuildinfo). Fix: no-op touch the file → forced recompile → error gone. Lesson:
  `console_logs` returns a STALE buffer; trust live DOM (`hasErr` check) + a fresh recompile.
- **`preview_screenshot` times out (30s) on the episode page** — repeatedly. Not a render
  error (page interactive, verified via eval). Heavy ambient SVG field / large DOM. Used
  `preview_eval` DOM measurement as proof instead — more reliable here.
- **Editing .tsx in `===1===`** — blocked by `mode-validator.cjs` hook (applies to webapp
  source too, not just SS- film files). Required Director to activate `===5===` (он сделал).
- **`includes('Workstation')` check returned false despite working** — false alarm:
  `innerText` reflects CSS `text-transform:uppercase` → DOM text was "WORKSTATION".
  Feature works; the test was case-sensitive against transformed text.

